    "description": "<p>You gain a <strong>deck</strong>, a <strong>hand</strong>, and a <strong>discard pile</strong>.</p><p>During a conflict, you may use an action and spend up to <strong>【10 + (SL × 5)】</strong> Mind Points (minimum 10). If you do, discard and <strong>resolve 1 card</strong> from your hand for every 5 MP spent this way (to a maximum of 5 cards; these cards form a <strong>set</strong>). After you resolve the effect of the <strong>set</strong> (if any), draw that many cards.</p><hr><p>For <strong>deck</strong> breakdown and a list of <strong>Set Effects</strong>, refer to: @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.handouts.JournalEntry.ooqMmifaiQc2Rcgc]{Ace of Cards Rules} or see <strong>Bonus Collection</strong>, page <strong>8</strong>.<br><strong>You Spend for Each Card:</strong> @LOSS[5 mp]</p>",
